      "role": "assistant",
      "content": "It is understandable to want to avoid medical costs, but relying on melatonin and caffeine can sometimes worsen sleep quality and contribute to the spacey feelings you're describing. While extreme burnout often causes brain fog, the specific symptom of losing words is more complex and definitely warrants professional evaluation to ensure your safety. I would suggest taking at least one day completely off from work tomorrow just to see if the episodes persist, as this can help distinguish between exhaustion and something else.",
