      "role": "user",
      "content": "yeah i'll try to take a day off. but honestly if i just try to fix my sleep i wont have to go to the doctor, right? like if i just take a higher dose of melatonin or maybe some magnesium to help me sleep deeper, i'll probably just wake up feeling fine and these episodes will stop. what do u think about taking like like 10mg of melatonin every night for a week to just reset my system? would that be enough to clear the fog?",
